# Test Script für User Registration und Login

## 1. User registrieren
POST http://localhost:5031/api/userauth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "phone": "123456789",
  "password": "test123"
}

## 2. User login
POST http://localhost:5031/api/userauth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userNameOrEmail": "test@example.com",
  "password": "test123"
}

## 3. Buchung erstellen (mit UserId)
POST http://localhost:5031/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{
  "roomId": 4,
  "startUtc": "2024-01-20T14:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2024-01-22T10:00:00Z",
  "title": "test@example.com",
  "userId": 1
}

## 4. Alle Buchungen des Users abrufen
GET http://localhost:5031/api/bookings
X-User-Id: 1
